## UnifiedMQ S1 VM arguments. Copied into the release as releases/Vsn/vm.args by
## relx ({vm_args, ...} in rebar.config); `rebar3 shell` does not read this file.
## Every flag must be accepted by erts-16.2 (OTP 28.3.1) -- validated by
## `rebar3 release` followed by actually booting the node, not by documentation.

-name unified_mq@127.0.0.1

## Time warp mode for the fsync latency budget of ADR-007 L2.
## NOTE: the erts flag is `-C`, and its value is `multi_time_warp`.
## `+C multi_scheduling` is rejected by erts ("Invalid time warp mode").
-C multi_time_warp

## Do not let busy-waiting schedulers steal CPU from the WAL group committer.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Message queue bounds: a runaway partition worker must be killed and restarted
## rather than absorbing an unbounded backlog.
+Q 1000000

-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 100
